(FULL ARCHITECTURE & SYSTEM DESIGN REPORT) ' 
(=============================================================) ' 
() ' 
(1. EXECUTIVE SUMMARY & HOW IT WORKS) ' 
(JobShield combines Google Gemini 3.6 Flash, Apache PDFBox document parsing,) ' 
(and Jaccard keyword pattern matching to protect job seekers from scam offers.) ' 
(- Step 1: User submits text or uploads offer letter PDF.) ' 
(- Step 2: Spring Boot backend validates JWT authentication and extracts text.) ' 
(- Step 3: Google Gemini AI evaluates scam indicators and returns Risk Score.) ' 
(- Step 4: ScamSimilarityEngine matches patterns \(FEE, WHATSAPP, TELEGRAM\).) ' 
(- Step 5: Postings >= 80% similarity are grouped into ScamCampaign clusters.) ' 
(- Step 6: MySQL stores analysis; frontend updates dashboard & history.) ' 
() ' 
(2. TECHNOLOGY STACK) ' 
(- Frontend: React 19, Vite, React Router, Pure CSS \(Cybersecurity Dark Theme\)) ' 
(- Backend: Java 17, Spring Boot 4.x / 3.x, Spring Security, JWT \(JJWT 0.12.7\)) ' 
(- AI Engine: Google Gemini 3.6 Flash via Spring RestClient) ' 
(- Document Engine: Apache PDFBox 3.0.3 \(text extraction from PDFs\)) ' 
(- Database: MySQL \(jobshield_db\) with Hibernate JPA ORM) ' 
() ' 
(3. REACT COMPONENT ARCHITECTURE) ' 
(- App.jsx: Main routing tree with public and ProtectedRoute gatekeepers.) ' 
(- api.js: Centralized fetch service with automatic JWT injection & error handling.) ' 
(- ProtectedRoute.jsx: Guards private pages and renders persistent Sidebar.) ' 
(- AnalysisResultCard.jsx: Visual score card \(0-100\), AI explanation, and badges.) ' 
(- DashboardPage.jsx: Live threat metrics and pure CSS risk distribution bar.) ' 
(- AnalyzeJobPage.jsx: Text analysis form connected to POST /api/jobs/analyze.) ' 
(- PdfScannerPage.jsx: Drag-and-drop PDF upload connected to /api/jobs/analyze-pdf.) ' 
(- HistoryPage.jsx: User scan log with modal drilldown \(/api/jobs/{id}\).) ' 
(- CampaignsPage.jsx: Multi-company scam syndicate intelligence.) ' 
() ' 
(4. SAMPLE TEST PDFS PROVIDED) ' 
(- sample_pdfs/Sample_Scam_Job_Offer_Letter.pdf \(Risk Score: 100 - HIGH\)) ' 
(- sample_pdfs/Sample_Legitimate_Job_Offer_Letter.pdf \(Risk Score: 10 - LOW\)) ' 
() ' 
(Report generated on September 5, 2026. All rights reserved.) ' 
